.TH CURL-OPTIONS 1 "2026-10-26" "BetterMan regression fixture"
.SH NAME
curl-options \- nested range examples must not own command flags
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-r, \-\-range <range>
Retrieve a byte range. Examples:
.RS
.TP
0-0,-1
The first and last byte only.
.TP
500-999
Bytes from offset 500 to 999.
.RE
.TP
.B \-1, \-\-tlsv1
Use TLS version 1.x.
